    "sourceContradictions": "Complete single-pass source reconciliation by GPT-6.1 Sol ultra. Personally read all15 question PDF pages and all36 solution PDF pages, including repeated questions, boundaries, references and additional solution-edition diagrams. Original18 task IDs and all original question wording preserved. Restored p11 ending and complete printed p12–18 keys and later diagrams, without deriving substitute solutions. Retained first11 existing key text after direct visual comparison. Five song excerpts intentionally omitted with declared original-source links; no song lyrics redistributed. Reference tables A1–A9 restored from matching page values; solution edition adds Sun/equation-of-time and HR diagrams, retained separately. Native question editions differ in p6 speed wording, p14 calendar wording and p17 ice-cap wording; question-only edition remains statement source. Cover question date2017 and solution date2018 are preserved: olympiad SAMRAS-2018 spans15.10.2017–15.01.2018. No total score printed. Source errors retained literally: p12 equation25 uses y_e/z_e for polar satellite, p21 calls minimum-separation triangle isosceles then alpha60; p13 calls angular radius diameter; p14 fractional error/calendar values12.368,0.4645,12.4643 and leap-year464/465 mutually inconsistent; p16 c printed with m/s^2 and numerical dark-matter values retained; p17 gravity g/g0 differs and rho_l/rho_H2O denote ice; p18 relative orbit labeled R*_prime. No independent model checker; automated schema/math/textlayer/figure/MDX gates only. Historical draft reader retained in baseline snapshot. Source coverage in paper.solutionSource.pages names the adopted author/key/reference pages; all36 solution PDF pages were personally read, including repeated questions and divider pages, as retained in reader evidence. Text-layer question-edition differences on repeated pages5,7,9 were source-validated; original question edition remains canonical. Corrected my restoration slip «измерим» to printed «измерив» and restored the printed conjunction «и» in p15 after direct page23 visual reread.",
    "cropLayoutNotes": "The native source wraps adjacent prose tightly around some diagrams. Tiny adjacent prose glyph traces occur at the far margin of p10/p12/p13/p18 crops; all native diagram labels, geometry and graph axes remain complete. No redraw, inferred geometry or glyph masking performed.",
